// @run
// @log 0
// @log 2147483647
// @log 5
// @log end
// A constant step of `-2147483648` is an i32, decimal or radix, and folds like any other
// negated literal step. Each loop stops before its next step would leave the i32 range.
for i in 0 to -1 step -2147483648 { print(i) }
for i in 2147483647 to 0 step -2147483648 { print(i) }
for i in 5 to 3 step -0x80000000 { print(i) }
print("end")
